    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/d82cabf821aa9ec12fced83ac4060eab.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead &amp; Blood is a fast-paced arena shoot 'em up with a dark and eerie atmosphere. Take control of a bloodthirsty huntress, ready to tear cultists apart in a secluded forest clearing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Huntress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/be9a9d4e4f2e09a4bfa0a56b6ea00e6a.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=686 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/be9a9d4e4f2e09a4bfa0a56b6ea00e6a.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/be9a9d4e4f2e09a4bfa0a56b6ea00e6a.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon combinations vary between huntresses, giving each a unique way to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/3e0f9af5f89f89df3992e99bf45c500d.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/3e0f9af5f89f89df3992e99bf45c500d.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/3e0f9af5f89f89df3992e99bf45c500d.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light:</strong> Wields a shotgun that fires 3 projectiles at once, capable of piercing through enemies. She also carries a baseball bat, perfect for deflecting incoming projectiles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marshal:</strong> Uses a high-fire-rate rifle to unleash rapid shots at enemies, along with a katana capable of slicing through both foes and projectiles with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megan:</strong> Carries a plasma gun that fires a spread of projectiles, and a bazooka that creates mini black holes, annihilating any cultist they come into contact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relentless Violence. No Breaks.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/07a84f2aa50b7ee3ad3009dda82c8c76.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/07a84f2aa50b7ee3ad3009dda82c8c76.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/07a84f2aa50b7ee3ad3009dda82c8c76.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless hordes of enemies close in from all sides.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge fireballs and other brutal attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hourglasses scattered across the map to extend your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically use your arsenal to take down the cultists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultist Squad with Unique AI Behaviors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4b716950a6f509d11511e8c97ea5d0f0.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4b716950a6f509d11511e8c97ea5d0f0.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4b716950a6f509d11511e8c97ea5d0f0.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has unique attack and movement patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can be hit by bullets you deflect back at them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoners</strong>: shoot fireballs from a distance with varied patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runners</strong>: charge at high speed to perform melee attacks, constantly trying to get close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Achievements and Fill Your Shelves with Bloody Loot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4366094e06b39ab9752979e329877632.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4366094e06b39ab9752979e329877632.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4366094e06b39ab9752979e329877632.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unlocked achievement transforms into a new creepy item displayed on the shelf in the \u2018Collection\u2019 menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements range from reaching specific scores with each character to completing challenges like using only a specific type of weapon.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/d82cabf821aa9ec12fced83ac4060eab.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead &amp; Blood is a fast-paced arena shoot 'em up with a dark and eerie atmosphere. Take control of a bloodthirsty huntress, ready to tear cultists apart in a secluded forest clearing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Huntress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/be9a9d4e4f2e09a4bfa0a56b6ea00e6a.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=686 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/be9a9d4e4f2e09a4bfa0a56b6ea00e6a.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/be9a9d4e4f2e09a4bfa0a56b6ea00e6a.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon combinations vary between huntresses, giving each a unique way to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/3e0f9af5f89f89df3992e99bf45c500d.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/3e0f9af5f89f89df3992e99bf45c500d.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/3e0f9af5f89f89df3992e99bf45c500d.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vide