que AI Behaviors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4b716950a6f509d11511e8c97ea5d0f0.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4b716950a6f509d11511e8c97ea5d0f0.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4b716950a6f509d11511e8c97ea5d0f0.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has unique attack and movement patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can be hit by bullets you deflect back at them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoners</strong>: shoot fireballs from a distance with varied patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runners</strong>: charge at high speed to perform melee attacks, constantly trying to get close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Achievements and Fill Your Shelves with Bloody Loot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4366094e06b39ab9752979e329877632.poster.avif?t=1752600787\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4366094e06b39ab9752979e329877632.webm?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784420/extras/4366094e06b39ab9752979e329877632.mp4?t=1752600787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unlocked achievement transforms into a new creepy item displayed on the shelf in the \u2018Collection\u2019 menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements range from reaching specific scores with each character to completing challenges like using only a specific type of weapon.</p></li></ul>",
